<div class="mir-prose">
  <h2>How pricing works</h2>
  <p>Your quote is the price you pay. It's parts plus labour, with prepaid insured shipping both ways{% if settings.mir_shipping_fee > 0 %} for a flat {{ settings.mir_shipping_fee | times: 100 | money }}{% else %} included{% endif %}. Tax is added based on your province. No hidden fees.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Standard repairs:</strong> exact price upfront.</li>
    <li><strong>Specialized repairs:</strong> a fixed diagnostic fee, then a firm quote you approve.</li>
    {%- if settings.mir_bundle_percent > 0 -%}<li><strong>Bundle:</strong> fix 2 or more things at once and save {{ settings.mir_bundle_percent }}%.</li>{%- endif -%}
  </ul>
  <h2>Part quality tiers</h2>
  <p>Some repairs come with more than one part option. Not every repair has every tier. Your quote only shows the ones available for your model.</p>
</div>
<div class="mir-tierexplain">
  {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
    {%- assign kn = 'mir_tier_' | append: i | append: '_name' -%}{%- assign kd = 'mir_tier_' | append: i | append: '_desc' -%}{%- assign kp = 'mir_tier_' | append: i | append: '_placeholder' -%}
    {%- if settings[kn] != blank -%}
      <div class="mir-card">{%- if settings[kp] -%}<span class="mir-badge mir-badge--ph">PLACEHOLDER COPY</span>{%- endif -%}<h3>{{ settings[kn] }}</h3><p>{{ settings[kd] }}</p></div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>
<div class="mir-prose">
  <h2>Turnaround by region</h2>
  <p>Door-to-door time is shipping to us, repair time, and shipping back. Repair time depends on the job and is on your quote.</p>
  <div class="jr-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Region</th><th>Shipping each way</th><th>Surcharge</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {%- assign rl = settings.mir_regions | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
    {%- for l in rl -%}{%- assign c = l | split: '|' -%}{%- if c.size > 2 -%}
      <tr><th>{{ c[0] | strip }}</th><td>~{{ c[2] | strip }} business days</td><td>{% assign sc = c[3] | strip | plus: 0 %}{% if sc > 0 %}{{ sc | times: 100 | money }}{% else %}None{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
  </tbody></table></div>
  <p>Rural postal codes (second character 0, like K0A) add about 2 days each way.</p>
  <h2>Warranty</h2>
  <p>Every repair has a warranty on the part and the work. Length depends on the part tier you pick and is shown on your quote and receipt. It covers part failure and workmanship. It doesn't cover new drops, cracks or liquid damage.</p>
  <h2>Policies</h2>
</div>
{% render 'mir-policies' %}
